      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>22/07/2025</color>\n\"Di permukaan air, masa depan dan masa lalu saling bersilangan. Tabir dusta mulai tersingkap ....\"\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/40132513</color>"
